List agents in a team

Usage:
  mcp-runtime agent list [team-slug] [flags]

Flags:
      --cursor string   Continue a paginated result
  -h, --help            help for list
      --limit int       Maximum records (1-200) (default 50)
      --query string    Filter by agent name
      --status string   Filter by active or inactive status

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
